# Electron IPC surface

You are editing the IPC surface. In `AGENTS.md`, read **IPC channel ownership** for the channel→service table, plus **Facades whose export shape is pinned**.

Renaming or re-shaping a channel means updating the owning `src/main/` service, `src/preload.js`, and **every** renderer call site — source-scan tests pin the channel names. Prefer new logic in `src/main-process/` or a `src/main/` service over growing `src/main.js`.
